  "solution": "Tập xác định của hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tĐặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>⇔</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tBảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e83d2db403190670bc5250924a9a3dc89bbb20b98f6ebc263059724d9fd2644e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tKhi đó bài toán trở thành tìm giá trị nhỏ nhất của hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> trên đoạn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∉</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tLại có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML